  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在立体几何里，引入向量概念的方法，同平面几何里一样.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 55,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0062#13",
        "p0063#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "研究由不重合的点组成的有序点对$(A, B)$. 它确定一条始点为$A$和终点为$B$的有向线段(图66). 利用点对$(A, B)$可给出空间的一个变换. 每一个点$M$的对应点$M_1$可由以下的作法得到.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 56,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0063#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-66",
      "label": "图 66",
      "printed_page": 56,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0063#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-67",
      "label": "图 67",
      "printed_page": 56,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0063#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 66",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 66",
      "printed_page": 56,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0063#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 67",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 67",
      "printed_page": 56,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0063#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "把点$M$作为起点，作与射线$AB$同方向的射线$m$(图67).在射线$m$上有唯一的点$M_1$，它和$M$的距离为$|AB|$. 这个作法给出将点$M$映射成点$M_1$的空间变换.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 56,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0063#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**定义. 如果一个空间变换将每一个点$M$映射成这样的点$M_1$，射线$MM_1$与射线$AB$($A$、$B$是不重合的点)同方向，且距离$|MM_1|$等于距离$|AB|$；那么这个空间变换叫做由不重合的点对$(A, B)$确定的向量(平移).**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 56,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0063#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "由不重合的点对$(A, B)$给出的向量用符号$\\overrightarrow{AB}$表示. 由射线$AB$确定的方向叫做**向量$\\overrightarrow{AB}$的方向**，而距离$|AB|$是**向量$\\overrightarrow{AB}$的长度**.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 56,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0063#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们约定，任何重合的点对给出恒等变换，以后我们称它为**零向量**. 零向量的长度等于零；对于它不引进方向的概念.由点对$(A, A)$给出的**零向量**，用符号$\\overrightarrow{AA}$表示.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 56,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0063#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "也可用另外的符号$\\vec{a}$，$\\vec{b}$，$\\vec{c}\\cdots$表示向量；用$|\\vec{a}|$或者$a$表示向量$\\vec{a}$的长度；$\\vec{0}$表示零向量.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 56,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0063#11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "每一个非零向量具有两种特性，即本身的方向和长度. 因此，如果非零向量方向相同，并且长度相等，那么这两个向量相等（重合）：$\\vec{a}=\\vec{b}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0064#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "设已知向量$\\vec{a}$和点$A$，可以作唯一的点$B$，使得$\\overrightarrow{AB}=\\vec{a}$（图68）. 这个作法叫做由点$A$出发作向量$\\vec{a}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0064#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "如果向量$\\vec{a}$将点$M$映射成点$M_1$，那么记作：$\\vec{a}(M)=M_1$或者$\\vec{a}=\\overrightarrow{MM_1}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0064#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-68",
      "label": "图 68",
      "printed_page": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0064#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-69",
      "label": "图 69",
      "printed_page": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0064#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 68",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 68",
      "printed_page": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0064#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 69",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 69",
      "printed_page": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0064#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "空间的向量具有以下的性质：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0064#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**1. 向量是位移.**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0064#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**2. 向量将射线映射成和它同向的射线，将直线映射成和****它平行的直线.**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0064#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**3. 向量将平面映射成和它平行的平面.**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0064#11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "前两个性质的证明，同平面几何的证明相同. 因此，只剩下第三个性质的证明. 假设已知向量$\\vec{a}$和平面$\\alpha$（图69）. 向量$\\vec{a}$是位移（性质1），因此它将平面$\\alpha$映射成某个平面$\\alpha_1$（§15）. 我们来证明，$\\alpha_1\\mathbin{//}\\alpha$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0064#12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在平面$\\alpha$上作两条相交的直线$b$和$c$. 假设$\\vec{a}(b)=b_1$，$\\vec{a}(c)=c_1$. 这时，$b_1\\mathbin{//}b$，$c_1\\mathbin{//}c$（性质2）. 根据平面平行的判定得出，$\\alpha_1\\mathbin{//}\\alpha$. $\\blacksquare$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 57,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0064#13",
        "p0065#1"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
